message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "dsh-writing-suite"
abstract: >-
  A unified writing toolchain for DeepSeek Harness that combines tutorial and
  Markdown auditing, academic-paper scaffolding and evidence review, LaTeX and
  site build diagnostics, deck/layout checks, and geometry-based audits of TikZ
  neural-network diagrams.
